{"id":"lesson-1751","topicId":1751,"title":"第八单元","sourceTitle":"第八单元","blockId":"bixiu-xia","blockTitle":"必修下","forumUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/t/topic/1751","createdAt":"2024-08-22T13:32:01Z","updatedAt":"2024-08-27T09:57:32Z","postCount":1,"excerpt":"天下兴亡,匹夫有责。古往今来,众多仁人志士自觉承担匡世济民的责任,积极建言献策,勇于变法图强。他们忧国忧民,心怀天下,坚守道义,敢于担当,令后人崇敬景仰。 本单元作品文体多样,有直言进谏、警示君主的奏疏,有据理辩争、剖白心迹的书信,有立足现实、评说盛衰的辞赋,有借古讽今、以史为鉴的史论。这些作品思路缜密,表达技巧高超,可以激发我们关注现实,深入思考。 本单元学习,围绕“倾听理性的声音”这一核心任务展开。要注意领会作者观点及其现实针对性,掌握其解决现实问题的理性思维方式,鉴赏文章的说理艺术,学会在辩证分析与合理推理的基础上进行理性判断,养成大胆质疑、缜密推断的批判性思维习惯。","textbook":{"bookId":"高中_语文_普通高中教科书_语文必修_下册","bookTitle":"普通高中教科书·语文必修 下册（人教版）","imageBase":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/9535dacc9628","tocLabel":"第八单元","tocScore":1.11,"startPage":149,"pages":[149],"pageImages":[{"page":149,"src":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/9535dacc9628/p149.webp","label":"p149","matched":true}],"contextPages":[129,130,131,132,133,134,135,136,137,138,139,140,141,142,143,144,145,146,147,148,149,150,151,152,153,154,155,156,157,158,159,160,161,162,163,164,165,166,167,168,169],"contextPageImages":[{"page":129,"src":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/9535dacc9628/p129.webp","label":"p129","matched":false},{"page":130,"src":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/9535dacc9628/p130.webp","label":"p130","matched":false},{"page":131,"src":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/9535dacc9628/p131.webp","label":"p131","matched":false},{"page":132,"src":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/9535dacc9628/p132.webp","label":"p132","matched":false},{"page":133,"src":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/9535dacc9628/p133.webp","label":"p133","matched":false},{"page":134,"src":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/9535dacc9628/p134.webp","label":"p134","matched":false},{"page":135,"src":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/9535dacc9628/p135.webp","label":"p135","matched":false},{"page":136,"src":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/9535dacc9628/p136.webp","label":"p136","matched":false},{"page":137,"src":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/9535dacc9628/p137.webp","label":"p137","matched":f